rt Solara or Xeno"},"edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-10-20T17:07:29.010Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"6ad7d9331e735b5810e9e250","commentBy":{"_id":"6aa4b772660f4023982e748b","username":"adn_","verified":false,"keylessCreator":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"lastActive":"2026-10-22T17:27:37.038Z","createdAt":"2026-09-12T02:22:42.966Z","lvl":5,"status":"offline","id":"6aa4b772660f4023982e748b","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"text":"@Daedalix GPBHub won’t be supported for Solara or Xeno. The hub needs getgc and getgenv to work, and both executors fail them (check their sUNC reports on ScriptBlox). Without those, the hub can’t find the game’s data, so most features won’t work. Use a 100% sUNC executor like Potassium, Wave or Volt. For free ones Real and Madium exist.","parent":{"_id":"6ad79fd10458d596484c752c","commentBy":{"_id":"69c9bf9a7856234bd3563721","username":"Daedalix","profilePicture":"/images/photo/69c9bf9a7856234bd3563721-1789684454794.png","status":"offline","id":"69c9bf9a7856234bd3563721"},"text":"@adn_ You can make it suport with Xeno, pls?"},"edited":false,"likeCount":2,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-10-20T21:12:19.524Z","liked":false,"disliked":false}]}